    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d150-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d150-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Johnson Library, National Security File, NSC Meetings File, Vol. 3. Top
                    Secret/Sensitive; For the President Only. Drafted by Smith.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d150-f2" n="2" xml:id="d150-f2-content">
                <p>King Constantine’s September 3 reply to the President’s August 28 message stated
                    that Greece could not accept the Acheson proposals. (Ibid., Country File,
                    Greece, Presidential Correspondence)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
